              23                     !     *  sundqvist et al., (1989) monthly weather review. (august)     *
              24                     !     *                                                                *
              25                     !     ******************************************************************
              26                     !
              27                     !     ************ important note *************
              28                     !     in this code vertical indexing runs from surface to top of the
              29                     !     model
              30                     !
              31                     !     argument list:
              32                     !     --------------
              33                     !       im         : inner dimension over which calculation is made
              34                     !       ix         : maximum inner dimension
              35                     !       km         : number of vertical levels
              36                     !       dt         : time step in seconds
              37                     !       del(km)    : pressure layer thickness (bottom to top)
              38                     !       prsl(km)   : pressure values for model layers (bottom to top)
              39                     !       ps(im)     : surface pressure (centibars)
              40                     !       q(ix,km)   : specific humidity (updated in the code)
              41                     !       cwm(ix,km) : condensate mixing ratio (updated in the code)
              42                     !       t(ix,km)   : temperature       (updated in the code)
              43                     !       rn(im)     : precipitation over one time-step dt (m/dt)
              44                     !       sr(im)     : index (=-1 snow, =0 rain/snow, =1 rain)
              45                     !       tcw(im)    : vertically integrated liquid water (kg/m**2)
              46                     !       cll(ix,km) : cloud cover
              47                     !
              48                     
